# textbell

Text-message notifications for textbell.

Phone numbers are stored in E.164 form: a +, the country code and the subscriber number, digits only, at most 15 digits.

## Entering numbers

queueText accepts numbers the way people type them: with spaces, brackets, dots or dashes, and with the 00 international prefix instead of +. For example +44 20 7946 0958, 0044 20 7946 0958 and +1 (415) 555-0100 all work. National numbers without a country code are refused.
